    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I've been doing this thing lately where I try to think of what I'd miss. If I was just... gone. And the list is shorter than I expected. My wife's already gone. The kids don't want me. I retired six months ago so there's no work either. I'm not dramatic about it. I just sit here and count things up and the numbers don't look great.",
